  "classes": "6 - 10",
  "gender": "Co-ed",
  "description": "About Us Woodstock High School was founded in the year 2001 with a view to provide quality education for the students residing in the locality as well as those staying at far distance. The school is located close to Sombarey Bazar having easy access to banking/hospital facilities. The school also provides residential facilities for a limited number of students within the school premises. It is a home away from home for the having achieved cent percent success rate in the class X Board Examination that our two batches of students appeared during the past two academic sessions and the third batch of the students is all set to write their Class X Board Examinations in the near future. The medium of instruction is English with second language options of Nepali and Hindi. More stress is given to spoken English and overall discipline of a child. The school provides computer education from class III and above. Parents/Teachers meetings are scheduled to be held on quarterly basis from the ensuing new academic session onwards with a view to share information with parents and guardians about performance of their wards, whose work profile will be watched on regular basis by the, concerned class teachers and the Principal in the school.",
